  "releaseNotes": "'## [15.0.0-prerelease.6](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/compare/v15.0.0-prerelease.5...v15.0.0-prerelease.6) (2026-11-28)\n\n### ⚠ BREAKING CHANGES\n\n* See the [migration guide](https://dotnet.github.io/dotnet-operator-sdk/docs/operator/migration#upgrading-from-v14-to-v15) for upgrading from v14 to v15.\n* **abstractions:** add controller references and deduplicate owner references (#1355)\n\n### Features\n\n* **abstractions:** add controller references and deduplicate owner references ([#1355](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1355)) ([4979abe](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/commit/4979abedde3642f61b32cefa9e2abab8d11caa91)), closes [#1348](https://github.com/dotnet/dotnet-operator-sdk/issues/1348)\n'",
